  Finding the ttyrecs that go with a given ascension is a bit of an art.

  First, you need the list of ttyrec files for the player.  They're
ordered by date.  

  Here's the search page for players:

  <http://alt.org/nethack/plr.php?player=mrivan>

  Get the list of ttyrec files.


  Specific example:

<http://alt.org/nethack/ttyrec/mrivan/>

  Archived ttyrecs will be in a separate directory:
<http://alt.org/nethack/oldttyrec/mrivan/>


  The go to the list of all games, sorted by date.

<http://alt.org/nethack/player-all.php?player=mrivan>


  The date given is when the game ended.  Ttyrec files from before then,
but after the end of the previous game, are the ones you want.  Since
only the day, not hour or minute, the game ended is given you may get
some overlap with the previous and next games. 

  That's how I did a rough guide to mrivan's game on the first page
linked above.  Some checking helped settle doubts.  mrivan was easy,
given the first 22 games were ascensions. 



